   "start_sec": 47.556,
   "end_sec": 52.35,
   "duration_sec": 4.794
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C48-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "今日は授業があるので、伺えません。代わりに原稿と写真をメールで送ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C48-D010-S01",
    "C48-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.7,
   "end_sec": 58.934,
   "duration_sec": 6.234
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C48-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "田中",
   "source_text": "はい。原稿と案内の両方が必要です。文字が読めるように撮ってください。紙の案内も捨てないで残しておいてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C48-D011-S01",
    "C48-D011-S02",
    "C48-D011-S03",
    "C48-D011-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
